# Drive calculation

## Design parameters

- Conveyor length: 1.2 m
- Belt width: 300 mm
- Maximum load: 20 kg
- Belt speed: 0.3 m/s
- Pulley diameter: 80 mm (initial assumption)

## Pulley speed 线速度

v = pi * D * n / 60

n = 60 * 0.3 / (pi * 0.08)

n = 71.6 rpm （72rpm）

## Resistance force （阻力）

Assumed friction coefficient: μ = 0.25

Load friction: （摩擦阻力）

F_load = μ * m * g 重力

F_load = 0.25 * 20 * 9.81 = 49.05 N

Belt friction: （摩擦阻力）

F_belt = 3.62 N

Total resistance force:

F_total = 49.05 + 3.62 = 52.67 N


## Required torque（扭矩）

T = F_total * r

T = 52.67 * 0.04

T = 2.11 Nm


## Required power （功率）

P = F_total * v

P = 52.67 * 0.3

P = 15.80 W


## Preliminary design values

Assumed design factor: S = 1.5 （安全系数）

Assumed transmission efficiency: η = 0.85 （传动效率）

Design torque:

T_design = 2.11 * 1.5 / 0.85 = 3.72 Nm

Design power:

P_design = 15.80 * 1.5 / 0.85 = 27.88 W
